1200 BM$="Susanna: David! The Devil King is trying to erase your consciousness!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 BM$="David: He was only supposed to give me power!!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 BM$="Susanna: He tricked us all. He was always after your body - Rgh! Ack!!":GOSUB 5100
1230 GOSUB 9535:GOSUB 5920:BM$="David's consciousness wavered at Susanna's words. The blood of the Devil\King assaulted David's blood, and Susanna was once again being strangled.":GOSUB 5100
1240 BM$="Devil King: Susanna. As a dark sorceress, you should have known that\whoever breaks the dark laws must receive the ultimate punishment!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1250 BM$="David: Stop it! I'll give you my body if you want it so much! But if you kill\Susanna, I'll bite my tongue!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1260 BM$="Devil King: Do you believe you can make such a threat when you have no\control over ANY part of your body? My blood has already taken over.\Allow me to lend you my eyesight... Behold!":GOSUB 5100
