1290 BM$="Devil King: Come dawn, this body shall overflow with my powers. Then, under\the vigilant eye of the star of darkness, the blood of the King of the North\shall be severed once and for all!":GOSUB 5100
1300 COMMON FO:GOSUB 5610:GOSUB 5630:GOSUB 5620:BM$="David was losing consciousness, and could no longer see Susanna. He could\only hear the Devil King... He seemed so far away.":GOSUB 5100
1305 GOSUB 9000:'
1310 GOSUB 9070:GOSUB 6120:GOSUB 5880:BM$="Devil King: URGH! This pain in my chest... Rgh... It must be the spell of the\accursed King of the North!":GOSUB 5100
