1500 GOSUB 9515:BM$="The Devil King raised his arms, shouting his joy towards the star of\darkness... Then, David's body once again fell to the floor, writhing with\pain.":GOSUB 5100
1510 GOSUB 9565:BM$="Devil King: I... I cannot move! I feel no pain, and yet my body is writhing\uncontrollably... Ah! My blood! My blood is being overtaken by David's blood!\How could this be?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1520 GOSUB 9070:BM$="David: AARGH! M-My blood... feels like it's burning! My heart is going to burst!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1530 BM$="Devil King: The spell of the King of the North has no effect on my blood, but\it stirs David's, rousing it. Before long, he will regain consciousness, only\to die... and with his death, my blood will be severed!":GOSUB 5100
1540 BM$="Devil King: I have long waited for the star of darkness to shine upon the\planet... If I had not killed Susanna, I could have had her cast a defensive\barrier... Such a terrible mistake!":GOSUB 5100
1550 POLL X:COMMON FO:GOSUB 6130:GOSUB 9010:BM$="Suddenly, David stopped struggling, and all was quiet. Maybe his heart had\finally ruptured, or - No. He was not dead. David was pushing himself up.":GOSUB 5100:'
1560 BM$="Devil King: The magic of the King of the North has vanished. He must have\depleted his very life to cast so many spells in a row. However, that would\be a problem. If he died on his own, I wouldn't be able to take my revenge.":GOSUB 5100
1565 BM$="Devil King: Good... I still sense the warmth of David's blood.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1570 GOSUB 9020:GOSUB 6140:BM$="David: The spell of the King of the North is gone, and I'm alive... Devil King, do\you hear me?! You killed Susanna... and I'm going to avenge her!!":GOSUB 5100:'
1580 GOSUB 6150:BM$="With his consciousness in control, David moved his body up the stairs. He\left the basement, and then went further up.":GOSUB 5100
1585 GOSUB 6160:BM$="The Devil King had no energy left to stop him.":GOSUB 5100
1590 BM$="David: The King of the North beat you. Look! My blood has been revived, and\I can control my body. Why don't you try moving it? Come on! I'm waiting!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1600 BM$="Devil King: You fool! As long as the star of darkness exists, my blood is\eternal! In fact, my blood is already taking over yours as we speak!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1610 GOSUB 6170:GOSUB 9565:BM$="Gasping for air, David raised his eyes towards the top of the castle.":GOSUB 5100
1615 GOSUB 6180:BM$="With the little strength he had left, he forced himself to climb the stairs.":GOSUB 5100
1616 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6190:GOSUB 9030:'
1620 BM$="David: Devil King! Your rebirth came too late! Now that I'm here, at the top\of the castle, I can follow after Susanna. No matter how bright the star of\darkness shines, the Devil King can't resurrect if I'm DEAD!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1630 BM$="Devil King: S-Stop it, David! Have you lost your mind?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1640 BM$="Though his limbs felt numb, David managed to climb atop the castle's wall.\Holding on to his fading consciousness, he shouted at the Bellmare comet.":GOSUB 5100
1650 BM$="David: Hroth, the Devil King! I don't know how many have suffered, how\many have died to satisfy your thirst for revenge... But your hateful\bloodline ends with ME!":GOSUB 5100
1660 BM$="Thus, David threw himself over the wall.":GOSUB 5100
1670 GOSUB 9080:GOSUB 9515:GOSUB 5620:GOSUB 5630:BM$="Devil King: AAAAHHH!!!":GOSUB 5100
